OL,3,ANepalese authorities say 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing after flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-three people from the UK are
OL,7,Famong hundreds feared missing following
OL,8,Fa deadly flash flood near the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border.
OL,11,FFlooding and mud slides hit the Rasuaw
OL,12,Fregion in the morning on Wednesday,
OL,13,Fkilling at least 157 people in Nepal
OL,14,Fand three in Tibet, according to
OL,15,FChinese state media.
OL,17,FNepal police said 579 tourists are
OL,18,Fmissing - including 466 who are foreign
OL,19,Fnationals, from 28 different countries.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
