OL,3,AAunt killed in fire with niece was
OL,4,A'beautiful soul'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman killed in a house fire has been
OL,7,Fdescribed by her mother as "a beautiful
OL,8,Fsoul, who would have done anything for
OL,9,Fanybody".
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died along with
OL,12,Fher seven-year-old niece, Valentina
OL,13,FFoster, in the blaze in Grangetown,
OL,14,Fnear Middlesbrough, in the early hours
OL,15,Fof Wednesday.
OL,17,FCleveland Police said the fire had also
OL,18,Fleft a 48-year-old woman in a critical
OL,19,Fcondition in hospital alongside another
OL,20,Fthree people who suffered non-life
OL,21,Fthreatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
