OL,3,ATrump officials threaten Kennedy Center
OL,4,Ademolition if court blocks renovations
OL,5,
OL,6,F"An order blocking the Board from
OL,7,Fappropriately recognising President
OL,8,FTrump," the lawyers argued, "will cause
OL,9,Fdonors to flee, financial contributions
OL,10,Fto dry up, and structural
OL,11,Frehabilitation to stop".
OL,13,FThe venue has been among the storied
OL,14,Fsites in Washington that Trump has
OL,15,Fsought to renovate since he returned to
OL,16,Fthe White House in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
